desc
@Program that thoroughly tests the WCSLIB celestial coordinate transformation
routines, particularly celset(), by plotting oblique test grids for a wide
variety of transformation parameters.  A simple user interface provides
limited control of the path taken through this parameter space.  (Requires
PGPLOT and X11.)
@


